# Miriam, Herd Whisperer: "During your turn, Mounts and Vehicles you control have hexproof" (CR 611.3a, 702.11b) and the attack
# counter. On turn 3 Bot1's Brightfield Glider (a 1/1 Mount, not saddled) attacks and gets its counter; Bot2's Lightning Bolt
# cannot target the Glider that turn (refusal), but can target Miriam herself (neither Mount nor Vehicle: the positive
# control), who dies. On Bot2's turn 4 the Glider is no longer hexproof and the other Bolt kills it (2/2 with the counter).

